---
// ArchitectureSection.astro - Responsive diagram and comparison table
---

<section id="architecture" class="py-12 sm:py-20 md:py-24 border-b border-border-subtle overflow-hidden">
  <div class="px-4 sm:px-8 md:px-10">
    <!-- Header Block -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-8 sm:mb-12">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted mb-2">
        BYOK ARCHITECTURE & PRIVACY
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-ink leading-tight">
        Your keys stay in your browser. No proxy servers, ever.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
        Modern social extensions often route your sensitive browsing feeds through private cloud servers. Replyly is engineered from the ground up to be 100% client-side: your browser initiates direct encrypted HTTPS requests to AI providers using your locally saved keys.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Direct Architecture Visual -->
    <div class="my-8 sm:my-12">
      <img
        src="/architecture-diagram.jpg"
        alt="Replyly Architecture and Data Flow"
        class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full h-auto object-contain block"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      <div class="mt-3 text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted text-center px-2">
        Figure 1.0 — Direct client-side request flow via Chrome Manifest V3 sandbox
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparison Table (Responsive with mobile swipe cue) -->
    <div class="border border-border-subtle overflow-hidden bg-surface mt-10 sm:mt-16 shadow-sm">
      <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 border-b border-border-subtle bg-surface-muted/50 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">Architecture Comparison</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-0.5">How Replyly compares to typical commercial AI extensions</p>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-secondary self-start sm:self-auto">
          Data Verified
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Mobile Scroll Cue -->
      <div class="block sm:hidden text-[11px] font-mono text-ink-muted text-right px-4 py-1.5 bg-surface-muted/30 border-b border-border-subtle">
        ← Swipe horizontally to compare →
      </div>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-left text-sm min-w-[500px]">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-border-subtle text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-ink-muted bg-surface-muted/20">
              <th class="py-3 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium">Dimension</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-ink">Replyly (Local-First)</th>
              <th class="py-3 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-ink-faint">Standard AI Wrappers</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-border-subtle text-ink-secondary">
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-ink">API Key Storage</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-mono text-xs text-ink">
                <span class="text-emerald-700 font-semibold">chrome.storage.local</span>
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-mono text-xs text-ink-muted">Central Cloud Database</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-ink">Telemetry & Logs</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-mono text-xs text-ink">
                <span class="tabular-nums font-semibold text-emerald-700">0 bytes collected</span>
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-mono text-xs text-ink-muted">All posts logged & analyzed</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-ink">Pricing Model</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-mono text-xs text-ink">
                <span class="font-semibold text-ink">Free ($0/mo)</span> + direct token cents
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-mono text-xs text-ink-muted">$15 – $30 / month</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-ink">AI Model Choices</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 text-ink">
                Google Gemini, Groq (Llama), OpenRouter
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 text-ink-muted">Single locked model wrapper</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-medium text-ink">Code Transparency</td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-mono text-xs text-ink">
                <a
                  href="https://github.com/HeaLthyDrugs/replyly"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noreferrer"
                  class="underline hover:text-ink transition-colors"
                >
                  100% Open Source (MIT)
                </a>
              </td>
              <td class="py-3.5 px-4 sm:px-6 font-mono text-xs text-ink-muted">Closed source black box</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
